		line=1147,
	},
	{
		{"fg", mode=-1, id=1, lv=""},
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=1153,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040080"},
		line=1153,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A certain extraordinary occurrence was the harbinger of the Empire's descent into aberrancy.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"On that midsummer day, the world was cast into darkness as an ominous shadow blotted out the noontide sun.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"At this direful sight, Tenkyo was plunged into chaos, the people fearfully whispering that the sun itself had been devoured by darkness.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Although the skies eventually brightened once more, the anxious murmurings of the people did not abate.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The rumors turned to speculation that the twilight of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's reign would soon be upon us.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Such was the unfortunate consequence of her attempts to deify herself.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Believing that as the child of Oomikami, she is its divine incarnation, the people naturally connect\nHimi-no-Mikoto's fate with that of the sun.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Even many among the thirty-six house heads were beguiled by these rumors...",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, what of the Chancellor of the Realm?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He was just now put to the blade.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Countless plumes of dark smoke rise up from the city.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Yet they do not carry with them the smell of the hearth.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"They curl up from the smoldering ruins of the estates that rose up in rebellion two days ago, as well as the countless pyres of dead soldiers and civilians.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The uprising was led by the chief minister of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's court, the Chancellor of the Realm.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Among the thirty-six noble houses, sixteen followed the chancellor in mustering their armies and raising the flag of rebellion.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The rebels numbered close to ten thousand, most of whom I cut down with mine own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Mine final act in quelling the rebellion just now was to execute the treacherous house heads and chancellor.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“With this, there are no other heads who would stand against you.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“With sixteen of them departed, would that that might be the case.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“We once fought alongside each other as comrades...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“They invited their own fate by rising up in rebellion.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even so, no human can help but lament that there was not a better way.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"This must be what makes me a mere tool.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I have no hesitation whatsoever in cutting down the enemies of Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Indeed, there were many familiar faces among those I slew the past few days.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It was I who entrapped them.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That was why I dispatched you on your western expedition and left Tenkyo undefended.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Seven nights ago, I departed Tenkyo on Himi-no-Mikoto's orders and concealed myself in a mountain cave.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"That was the opportunity the chancellor seized to raise his rebel army and capture Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"As soon as I received the message, I promptly rushed back to Tenkyo to face the assembled rebels.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"This was all part of Himi-no-Mikoto's stratagem to lure the traitors out.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“He was always looking for the opportunity to mount his rebellion.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It must have given him quite the fright when he learned of your return.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“They surely never expected to confront the avatar of havoc that single-handedly sundered Ko no Kuni's armies.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“So it was all a ploy to eradicate the house heads harboring treacherous ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Exactly so.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Then you have nothing to trouble yourself over. It was for the sake of preserving peace in the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Certainly, the Empire will be free from strife for some time to come.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But this peace came at the cost of countless souls untimely slain.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Behold those billows of smoke.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"More and more plumes of smoke curl up from Tenkyo towards the dusky sky.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Each of them, a pyre for the heaps of bodies for which there were not enough graves.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Because of my weakness... Because of my folly, I could only resort to violence.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If I had been a more virtuous Empress, they would not have harbored thoughts of rebellion...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“They could have continued to devote themselves to the Empire...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The tears helplessly spill over from her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why must we always resort to bloodshed?!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why must we always solve our problems with the tyranny of violence?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“We have the power of language! We are meant to be different from mere beasts!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto screams aloud her anguish, even as its physical manifestation streams down her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Men, too, can be beasts.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That is the reason for mine existence.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I know...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The weak are powerless to bring about peace. That is why I created you.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“No, I did far more than create you.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I wielded you to establish this Empire and seize my dominion.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have absolutely no right to grieve over bloodshed! No claim to shed even a single tear!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And yet, why...”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto fiercely wipes at her tears.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why must they continue spilling over?!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How pathetic... I am...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto has always been easily moved to tears.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"One might even call her a crybaby.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Begone... Get thee hence!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Tears are unbeseeming of a true Empress!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The teardrops spilling over from Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes are transfigured at once into pink petals drifting in the breeze.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"...What magicks could this be?",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Before I know it, countless petals dance through the air around Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"They flit and flutter on the wind, frolicking about their forlorn Empress.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heh... Heheh... This is as it should be...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“An Empress needs not any pitiful tears.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"There are no longer any tears glittering in Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"All that remains is the storm of flower petals billowing madly around her.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Did her self-reproach render her tears unto petals?",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"─What tragic, what noble teardrops these are.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heheh... Hahahahaha...!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto begins a graceful dance in the midst of that whirlwind of peach petals.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"A dance of Persica.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Her willowy arms glide through the air, each limb seemingly a branch adorned by countless peach blossoms in full bloom.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The blooming of Persica heralds the turning of the seasons and the budding of new life.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"This dance is her memorial to all those ill-fated souls untimely slain; an elegy to console their grief and usher them unto a new spring.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"An earnest entreaty that Oomikami's grace might cleanse their impurities and permit them to be reborn anew.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What do you think, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I know not how to appraise it.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"But were I to put these feelings in mine chest into words─",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is this... human emotion?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"─How fleetingly fragile. How indescribably beautiful, yet tinged with sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"For the rest of mine life, I shall never forget the sight I beheld here today.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I continue staring at Himi-no-Mikoto as though time itself stood still.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Gh...! *Cough... cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto breaks from her breathtaking dance, doubling over in a coughing fit.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The slender fingers covering her mouth drip with a vivid crimson.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I am fine...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Quell your agitation... This is hardly the first time...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Did I not tell you already? I am not long for this world.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even the sun in the sky is fated to eventually set... So it must be.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I slowly descend the hill, carrying Himi-no-Mikoto on mine back.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The road is somewhat uneven, but please try to bear with it.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hahaha... Perhaps 'tis not that bad to be so stricken, if you would always carry me like this.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto murmurs, meekly clinging to mine back without any trace of resistance.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"She must have pushed herself to the limits in the course of dealing with the rebellion.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'll summon the court physician as soon as we get back.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do not bother.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My body has been corrupted by magicks. No medicine could possibly grant me remedy.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Then will you do nothing but await your death?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hardly.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I would not have so hastened to purge the traitors in our midst if I did not have a plan in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...What?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"At that same moment, a refreshing melody drifts on the wind into mine ears.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"It's the same lullaby Himi-no-Mikoto always hums for me.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"But Himi-no-Mikoto is right here on mine back.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"If so... then who could its source be?",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Scanning the surroundings, mine eyes land upon a man leisurely reclining beneath the shade of a tall peach tree.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama! Well met...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You...!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"After his proposition to Himi-no-Mikoto, Tooru suddenly vanished without a trace.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"It was widely thought that as the captain of the Capital Watch, he might have been assassinated by the rebels, but the truth remained unknown to this day.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“To whence did you vanish without my permission?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Is it not obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“As per your noble request, I have been searching far and wide for the most beautiful vista known to this world.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Tooru declares with a reverent bow.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see. How noble a sentiment to harbor during this time of strife.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto spits bitingly as she climbs down from mine back.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Am I to suppose you found it?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I wandered all throughout the realm in search, but shamefully, I must confess that I found nothing to my satisfaction.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hence, I decided to create it myself.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Create it?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Behold!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Tooru stands up, spreading his arms wide.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, there is no vista more beautiful in all the world... than the very sight which lies before you.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Tooru gestures with outstretched arms towards the smoldering ruins of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"The skies above the ruined remains of the city are unnaturally darkened by the smoke of the still-raging funeral pyres.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Its streets, filled with the gruesome scent of death, are dreadfully silent save for the vicious screeching of carrion fowl.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Soon to be forsaken by the sun, the city is powerless but to frightfully cower as the cold shade of darkness encroaches.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Tenkyo is indeed beautiful beyond measure.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But now, it is naught but a sight of tragedy.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Nay, nay, I say! Never again will I be able to create a scene that is the equal of this!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Tooru pridefully declares with a smile as wide as the crescent moon.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Where is the beauty in this scene? Have you gone mad?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Come now, old chap, are you truly incapable of recognizing it?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Fields tainted, homes despoiled, lives robbed. Every street corner overflowing with the blood of the wretched and cruelly slain. What else could it be but ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"beautiful?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Look at the corpses burning on their pyres. Does the thought of their pitiful last moments not send a shiver down your spine?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Rancor and malice. Pain and suffering. Sorrow and anguish. Sweet, sweet despair!”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“This medley of the finest emotions known to man or beast will be eternally etched into Tenkyo's memory!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Never has there been a more beautiful vista than ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"He is truly mad.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Seemingly in agreement with me, Himi-no-Mikoto stares fixedly at him, not so much as twitching an eyebrow.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Am I to take this to mean that you incited this rebellion?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I silently loosen mine blade in its sheath.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Even after Mitsurugi left Tenkyo, the Chancellor of the Realm was still having second thoughts.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“So you see, he just needed a little nudge.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“And a little bird happened to whisper to him that if he obtained the treasure of Ko no Kuni, all the Empire would be at his fingertips.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's expression stiffens at this.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"If memory serves, the treasure of Ko no Kuni was a looking-glass of bronze.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"It was supposedly bestowed upon the Empire by the high priestess of Ko no Kuni in surrender, but I don't know anything beyond that.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“After hearing that, the chancellor finally found his resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I believe, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, that you know how the rest of the story goes.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“The sixteen treacherous house heads attacked Tenkyo, only to be routed once Mitsurugi unexpectedly returned from his expedition.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Thus together we begot... this vista currently before you.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Tooru's cheeks slacken with rapture as he gazes reverently upon the destruction he wrought.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"By this point, I am fully convinced.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Tooru does not relish this wretched vista out of mere affectation or whimsy.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"He truly finds this sight of tragedy intoxicating to the soul.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"...He's insane.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“This is an outrageous crime you've confessed to, Tooru.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Crime? I only rendered unto Himi-no-Mikoto-sama what she herself requested.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Besides, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama coveted this rebellion just as much as I.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Does that not make her equally guilty?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Still your tongue!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“All I did was simply neglect to draw the shutters on my home.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Though I left myself vulnerable to being taken advantage of by thieves, that does not make me guilty of the same crime.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The guilt rests solely with you and your cabal of traitors.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I have no interest in debating ethics with you.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Whether innocent or guilty, the truth remains that both you and I sincerely yearned for this outcome.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Thus, this sight before us...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Tooru gestures at the ruins of Tenkyo behind him.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Is nothing other than a creation from the union of our two hearts... Our beautiful child.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto silently glares at Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Who else but I could possibly be fit to be your groom?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“What say you, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama? Will you grant me your hand in marriage?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Tooru holds out his hand to Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Inou... What is it you truly desire?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It is surely not to take me as your bride.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“What I wish for... is your ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"everything.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Your vestal flesh, your noble heart, your exalted soul... I would have it ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"all.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hehehee... what a covetous man you are.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I wordlessly draw mine blade.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"I know not what has become of him, but the man before me is not the Tooru I once knew.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tell me one thing.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That melody you whistled earlier... how came you to know of it?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, this little thing?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Tooru whistles the tune once again.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"This lullaby which always sets mine heart at ease sounds terribly vulgar coming from his lips.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"It is as though mine very nerves are being scraped at from within.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, I couldn't help but overhear it every time you and Himi-no-Mikoto-sama indulged in your secret trysts here.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I thought that if only I learned this song, I might be permitted to join you.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru...”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Mine knuckles grow white around mine blade.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Mine lust for steel comes not from his intrusion of our privacy, but because that lullaby the two of us loved so dearly─",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Those irreplaceable moments of tranquility the two of us shared on this hillside─",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"All of it has been forever despoiled by this man.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Ah, I finally understand now...",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"─That song was mine and mine creator's most precious treasure.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Slay him.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ghhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Mine downward slash splits his chest asunder.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Tooru was mine dear friend.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"But having gone this far, he is beyond any salvation.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Tooru collapses into a rapidly expanding sea of his own blood.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Heheh... Ahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Y'didn't even hesitate for a second... Some friend you were...”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Wh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How...?!”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Even though his body is practically riven in two, Tooru merely smiles before continuing, as though sharing a leisurely chat with us.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I only just realized, y'see?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Seein' folkses dead just warms me heart.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Nah, more like I just can't go on livin' without killin'.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“S'just like how youse can't live without breathin'.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"This voice is clearly not that of Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"...Where have I heard it before?",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Thought for sure you'd at least get it, Mitsurugi, old chap.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“You're just like me, y'see? Neither of us can live without\nkillin'.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"I have indeed slain more people in my life than I can count.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"But... But I...",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi only kills those who threaten the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I will not tolerate you to compare yourself to him!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto defends me on mine behalf.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Heh... Hehehee... Ahh, y'really are just so beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I've just gots to make y'mine.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You will have no such opportunity any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Ain't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Well, go ahead and pray for me soul, won'tcha?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I've heard those words before.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"It was the same thing Himi-no-Mikoto said to that criminal before his execution.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Rest now.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto snaps her fingers, and bright blue flames immediately engulf Tooru's body.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"A cleansing flame of magicks.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Heh... heheh... ahahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I get it... So this is the end o' me life...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ahh, I've never felt better...”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Think I might even like this more than killin'.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"His lips still formed into a blissful smile, Tooru closes his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Aaahh... This vista once again...?”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“How cold... The snow... This black snow... pilin' up... more and more...”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Snow?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“What beautiful... black... snow...”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"With those final words, the man's body returns to ash.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"He no longer has any mouth with which to speak.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, what could Tooru... No, what could this man have been?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...I cannot say.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But he knew the words you spoke to that criminal.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Inou was also present at the execution.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Whatever the case, it is over now. Let us be off.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"The man's ashes slowly drift on the wind before vanishing, but Himi-no-Mikoto does not turn back to see it.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
